{"id":235326,"name":"Waterside D-103, 2BDR","headline":"The 2BDR Warmhearted Waterside Apt.","summary":"Scenic views, the utmost tranquility, and matchless convenience: are the characteristics of the rejuvenating escapades of Waterside Gouna. ","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nScenic views, the utmost tranquility, and matchless convenience: are the characteristics of the rejuvenating escapades of Waterside Gouna. \r\nYour stay in Waterside Condos would be a perfect gateway to unwind, relax, and be in the heart of all the action happening in El Gouna.\r\n\r\nIt features a spacious living room overlooking the lagoon, a walk in fully equipped kitchen, 2 full bathrooms.\r\nIt also features a 55 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. \r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire property\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n- Just minutes from Abu Tig marina (features many restaurants, cafes and bars)  \r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna (flat fee).\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors."},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":6,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":5,"number_of_bathrooms":2,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"Waterside community- Gouna","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.379537","location_lng":"33.659316","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":false,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_f