 the hosts are very organized.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5577027,"review":"Great experience and smooth check-in and check-out with Xuru.\nApartment is cozy, nice and clean","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5590277,"review":"It was a great stay for our group of friends, we really enjoyed the Pool and our Terrasse and little garden. Thank you","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5610596,"review":"The place was so clean and smelled fresh the minute we walked in. Everything was arranged like a hotel room with towels on each bed.\nThe kitchen utensils are new and usable. The place was as described in the pictures. Would definitely rebook it. Great value for the money👍🏽","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5633643,"review":"انصح التعامل معه والسكن جدا ممتاز","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5634450,"review":"Great place to stay in","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5639149,"review":"Amazing and cozy❤️","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5642496,"review":"Wonderful  apartment , very clean and the host is so helpful, i will recommend this place to my friends","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5650352,"review":"Its was clean, comfortable, and it has nice garden view.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:16.000000Z"},{"id":5658277,"review":"Extremely slow in response \nTheir call center are so rude and unhelpful, \nI received the Qr code too late , they insisted to make the check in @ 3 pm despite that the place was empty , the cleaning services came finally at 2:30 to get the place ready , and then they found that the water was cut off so we had to take the place uncleaned at almost 4 pm and we cleaned it ourselves\nI won’t deny that the area is perfect , the apartment was smaller than it seems in photo but acceptable but the hosted is the worse , \nI ll choose any place again on waterside but not with the same company ,","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669603,"review":"تجربة ممتازه نظافة ممتازة و خدمة مرضية منطقة هادئة و رايقة انبسطنا كثير كثير شكرا لكم","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5715189,"review":"Very good","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5746486,"review":"Super environnement nous avons adoré séjourner dans ce magnifique lieu ! \nJe recommande","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5753459,"review":"Simply perfection 👌","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5772832,"review":"Had a great and comfortable stay . Place was very clean and neat , the host is very responsive as well .","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5797083,"review":"We really liked our stay, everything was great and the host was always responsive, except the wifi was a bit slow. But we’ll definitely come back","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5811407,"review":"It was a very smooth and great stay. Also, people were very responsive whenever i have an inquiry","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5843825,"review":"Positive:\nL’agence de gérance est très réactif \nL’appart est bien situé et propre\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5865832,"review":".","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5868358,"review":"Everything was great and the host was more than helpful always would 100% recommend for a cozy getaway","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5892064,"review":"Great stay, perfect location, amazing host, very quick responses and very caring and helpful and attentive. Recommend for travelers who need a very convenient place that’s amazing value for money","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5907730,"review":"Exceptional value verses price. You get what u r promised.And above and beyond outstanding hosting support.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5912744,"review":"Çok iyi bir konaklamaydı. Problem yaşadığımızda çok hızlı dönüş aldık. Odalar özenle temizlenmişti.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5922727,"review":"Very nice and clean place , with great view , bathrooms are clean also the bedrooms","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5932250,"review":"Thank you for a great rental experience! The hosts are very friendly and responsive, the place was clean comfortable cozy and same as the pictures. \nWill definitely recommend it and we would love to come back.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5958169,"review":"غير مسموح بالتدخين \nلا يوجد أي مستلزمات نضافه وعند طلبها لم يتم الإرسال \nالشاليه بشكل عام كويس ولكن الخدمه ليست جيده \nتليفزيون عادى وليس سمارت","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6009925,"review":"Unit was okay and clean. The only downside is the cooker as its slow and very hard to use. The main issue is how difficult it is to reach Xuru Stays, I kept trying to reach them for 3 days and no one answers their hotline. The issue persisted at check in where we had to wait for almost 30 mins for them to answer the calls and send us someone with the keys. When we finally got the key and opened we found someone inside still cleaning and it was already 30 mins after check in time. The company called me later to compensate me by offer an extra one hour at checkout for free. The unit also did not have garbage bags, and when we asked for some, they said they will send but never got back. It wasn’t a very bad experience after all but had to mention those issues for fairness.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6081829,"review":"Good location 5 minutes away from downtown gouna and close to alot of restaurants and bars. Definitely recommended","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6112886,"review":"Good place","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6115139,"review":"Amazing place and very friendly and supportive staff, very clean and tidy match exactly the photos, peaceful and quiet place \nTotally recommend and definitely will come back","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6142985,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6159562,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6175839,"review":"The appt is nice and clean. Xuru team was very responsive and helpful.","rental_id":235326,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}